  "title": "Occasions perish subjectively and are immortal objectively",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "ce336994-0f83-436f-85f4-a6acfb4b3750",
      "text": "An actual occasion completes itself and perishes as a subject, losing its subjective immediacy and final causation, and gains objective immortality as a datum with efficient causation in later occasions. No subject experiences twice.",
